WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.500
This is last episode's dazzling recap!

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.290
The Junior Youth Championship is the 
gateway to becoming a pro duelist.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.780
To gain entry, Yuya battles 
against the cooking duel prince

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.280
Michio Mokota on an empty stomach.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:23.300
But Michio's terrifying hospitality 
destroyed all the monsters he Pendulum Summoned.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.620
Will Yuya be able to overcome this test?

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.880
And there's another man 
who's facing his own test!

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.200
I will hone my Immovable 
Duel skills even further.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.200
Yuya, stay strong!

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.170
You must win!

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:54.230
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:59.150
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:02.410
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.410
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.190
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.600
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.340
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:41.910
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.110
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:49.320
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.080
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:07.000
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.940
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.340
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:24.620
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.960
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:37.670
Splendid Spread!!  Full 
Stomachs for Everyone!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.140
Damn...

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:48.110
I set one card and end my turn.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.550
Yuya's Pendulum Monsters...

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.230
They were all destroyed.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:58.470
But his opponent's cooking monsters 
are also gone, so it's a tie.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.800
We'll see about that.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.050
My turn.  I draw!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.030
There are three cards inside Food Cemetery.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.850
My preparations are perfect!

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:13.070
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Regal Recipes's effect.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:17.680
For every card inside Food Cemetery,

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:22.750
I can Special Summon a 
Royal Cookpal from my hand.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.520
There are three cards inside Food Cemetery.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:30.190
So the three Royal Cookpals that 
were just eaten will all return?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.070
I'm placing the order!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.920
One order of Knight Pasta!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.070
One Prince Curry!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.170
One Princess Pudding!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.020
I know that they're 
dangerous monsters, but...

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.980
They look delicious!

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.670
Since you're hungry, I'll feed you plenty.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:03.920
You take 300 points of damage for every 
monster that Regal Recipes Special Summoned!

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:14.340
How's that?  Maybe it was too 
intense for someone who's starving.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:16.420
Nice, Michio.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:20.520
But my perfect recipe tastes great, right?

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.660
Perfect recipe...

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:27.270
Knight Pasta's effect activates!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:33.690
Once per turn, my Royal Cookpal's 
attack points are doubled.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:38.320
Princess Pudding uses the same 
effect to double it again.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.470
It's Michy's combo platter again!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:52.620
But my monsters that use this 
effect can't attack this turn.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.420
You have 1700 life points.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:00.280
Prince Curry needs one more 
ingredient to finish you.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.520
Good.  This is what I need.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:13.070
The goddess of cooking smiles upon me!

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:17.430
I activate the Action Spell Victory Topping!

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:23.770
During this turn, one monster 
gains 600 attack points.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.170
That's...

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.520
A pork cutlet!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.370
This will be your final meal!  Let's battle!

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:38.480
Prince Cutlet Curry attacks you directly!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.720
If that attack succeeds, Yuya will lose!

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:44.770
I activate the trap Performapal Call!

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:48.020
This card negates your direct attack!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.070
Then I add Performapals in my deck 
to my hand whose defense points

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:57.770
add up to your monster's attack points.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:00.470
Prince Curry has 1800 attack points.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:04.120
Therefore, I add Cheermole 
with 1000 defense points

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.970
and Turn Toad with 800 
defense points to my hand.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:12.640
But if I summon or Special 
Summon these monsters,

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:16.660
I can't Special Summon a monster 
from my Extra Deck that turn.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:21.500
You stopped a direct attack and 
added monsters to your hand.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.630
Impressive.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:29.370
In that case, I activate the 
trap card Canning Cuisine!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.300
When you add cards to your 
hand other than by drawing,

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:38.570
the same number of Cookpals in my 
deck are placed inside Food Cemetery.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:43.470
I put Cookpals Lionion and 
Rabbitomato inside Food Cemetery.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.270
He put cards into Food Cemetery again.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:51.890
I activate the spell card Food Fraud!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:56.120
I add two Royal Cookpals 
in my deck to my hand.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:02.330
I add Royal Cookpals King 
Burger and Queen Omelet.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.070
Two Royal Cookpals in his hand.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.470
Aren't my preparations excellent?

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:14.750
But when I use this effect to add monsters 
to my hand, I can't summon them this turn.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.070
I end my turn.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:24.000
Victory Topping, Princess Pudding 
and Knight Pasta's effects now end,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.970
so Prince Curry's attack 
points return to normal.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:33.720
On his next turn, he will 
have five Royal Cookpals.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.670
I have to do something before then.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.670
My turn!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.620
I can't do anything with a trap card!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.720
I have to rely on an Action Card!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.920
It's no good.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.970
I have no strength because I'm hungry.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.290
Sheesh.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:57.970
This is what happens when 
you don't eat breakfast.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.690
Mom!  Why are you here?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.900
Eat up so you can try harder!

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.370
Hooray!  It's my mom's pancakes!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.220
Thanks for the food!

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.170
What's this?

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:21.470
You didn't eat my mille-feuille pork 
cutlet, so I turned it into a sandwich.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.770
Delicious!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:31.120
That mille-feuille pork cutlet is perfect 
because I followed Michy's recipe exactly.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:35.320
But I had a new idea and 
sandwiched it between pancakes.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.070
You fiddled with my perfect recipe?

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:42.220
Perfect...  A new idea...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.170
All right!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.020
Power charge complete!

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:53.100
Due to Stargazer Magician 
and Timegazer Magician,

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:56.320
the Pendulum Scale from 1 
to 8 is set on my field.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.020
Therefore, I can summon monsters 
between Level 2 and 7!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.430
It's pointless.  Even if you summon 
them, they'll be destroyed.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:09.390
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:12.360
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.120
Pendulum Summon!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.820
Come out, my monsters!

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:22.450
Performapal Cheermole in defense position.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.510
Performapal Turn Toad.

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:28.520
That couple will meet their doom!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.880
I activate my Royal Cookpals' effects!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.570
Full Stomachs for Everyone!

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:39.720
When you summon or Special Summon a monster,

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.920
I can return a Royal Cookpal to my hand.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:47.170
For each one I return to my hand, 
I destroy one of your monsters!

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:51.370
I return Knight Pasta and 
Princess Pudding to my hand

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.720
to destroy Cheermole and Turn Toad!

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.870
Did you enjoy my hospitality?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.470
Destroying them isn't hospitality!

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:03.470
That's right!

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.870
You're horrible!

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:11.970
Pendulum Monsters go to the Extra 
Deck instead of the graveyard.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:18.570
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:26.220
Frightfur Bear attacks you directly!

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.720
I'm finished.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.220
All right!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.020
Did you see that?  Two wins in a row!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.960
You're daydreaming again.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:49.970
I'm not!  I was watching.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:56.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:11:01.370
Ma'am, you said that you 
fiddled with my recipe.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.920
Yes.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:09.010
You'll learn that you shouldn't 
mess with my perfect recipe.

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:10.650
That's right!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:13.970
My Michio is perfect!

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.490
There are five cards inside Food Cemetery.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:21.660
So due to the Continuous 
Spell Regal Recipes's effect,

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.320
I Special Summon four Royal Cookpals!

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.770
I'm placing the order!

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:29.500
One order of King Burger!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.470
One Queen Omelet!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:36.520
One Knight Pasta and one Princess Pudding!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.670
Like I expected, he summoned 
four monsters simultaneously.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:43.610
Curry, hamburger, omelet and pasta.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:45.150
And pudding.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:48.410
I won't be able to eat them all!

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:54.540
For every monster that Regal 
Recipes Special Summoned,

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.030
you take 300 points of damage.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.230
Yuya!

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:09.270
Yuya tried his best, but he has no 
chance against five Royal Cookpals.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:12.240
Knight Pasta's effect activates!

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:19.180
Once per turn, this monster doubles 
my Royal Cookpal's attack points.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:24.010
Next, Princess Pudding uses the 
same effect to double them again.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:32.980
Queen Omelet's effect doubles them again!

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:38.750
King Burger's effect doubles them again!

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:45.270
4800 attack points!  That's 
an explosion of calories!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.110
Let's battle!

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:51.640
Prince Curry attacks you directly!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:56.190
Golden Royal Cook Family Curry Plate!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.210
Golden...

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.530
Curry?

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.890
I activate the trap Wall of Disruption!

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:08.480
During this turn, your attacking monster

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:12.870
loses 800 attack points for 
every monster on your field!

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.570
You don't know when to give up.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.150
There are five monsters on your field!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.890
Therefore, it loses 4000 attack points!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.580
But you only have 500 life points.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.150
800 attack points are plenty!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.040
Oh well.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:54.980
I had a little bit of trouble, but you 
were no match for my perfect recipe.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.810
Yuya!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.830
Why?  Impossible!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.700
Why do you still have life points?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.070
I used an Action Card.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:20.040
It's the Action Card I 
couldn't get last time.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:25.780
The Action Spell Energy Biscuits 
raised my life points by 500.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:36.010
My mom's pancake sandwich gave 
me the strength to reach it.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.950
I end my turn.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:43.240
My Royal Cookpals' effects now end,

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:46.290
so Prince Curry's attack 
points return to normal.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:49.440
Even though you survived, you 
have zero cards in your hand!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:53.740
How can you fight against 
five Royal Cookpals?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.490
My turn!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.840
I'm as prepared as possible.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:00.180
All that's left is to draw that card.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.670
I draw!

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:13.670
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:17.820
It's time for the tumultuous climax!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.300
What's with him?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:28.010
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 
Timegazer Magician have already been set!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:33.090
Therefore, I can summon monsters 
between Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.680
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.650
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.650
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:43.270
Come out, my monsters!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.450
Pendulum Summon lets you 
summon many monsters at once,

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:50.930
but since you only have one card in your 
hand, it's the same as a regular summon.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.640
Now watch closely!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:57.260
Let me introduce the Pendulum 
Monsters in my Extra Deck

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.410
that have been waiting to show themselves!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.470
Extra Deck?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:13.620
Turn this difficult situation 
around, Performapal Turn Toad!

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:17.590
Bounce away your foes, 
Performapal Trampolynx!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:21.950
Show the power of your teammates, 
Performapal Partnaga!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:25.660
When you cheer, I'm filled with 
courage!  Performapal Cheermole!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:30.120
And our featured artist 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:34.640
I'm getting shivers!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.470
Five simultaneously?

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:40.580
Oh yeah!  Destroyed Pendulum 
Monsters go to the Extra Deck!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:46.050
He was waiting to gather all the Pendulum 
Monsters so that he could summon five simultaneously!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.760
He had a new idea for Pendulum Summoning.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.950
Ingenuity?  Whatever!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.920
Even if you summon five, the 
results remain the same!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:59.720
Your Pendulum Summon is no 
match for my perfect recipe!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:03.040
I activate the effects 
of five Royal Cookpals!

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.950
They'll be destroyed like last time!

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:16.240
For each Royal Cookpal that I return 
to my hand, one monster is destroyed!

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:19.320
Now all your monsters are destroyed!

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.950
I was waiting for that!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:22.810
What?

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.290
I activate the spell card Illusion Balloons!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:31.380
I flip over a card in my deck for 
every monster that was destroyed!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.210
Pancake sandwiches?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.670
Looks delicious!

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:36.920
Now watch!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:41.480
Due to Illusion Balloons's effect,

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:49.610
the top five cards in my deck are 
inside five pancake sandwiches.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:54.120
I will check each card inside one-by-one.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:59.950
And among those cards, I get to Special 
Summon the Performapal with the highest Level!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:04.180
Incredible!  When he summoned the five 
monsters, he expected them to be destroyed!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.820
And by destroying the five monsters,

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:08.980
he created a combo for a chance at victory!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.470
But there may be no Performapals 
among those five cards.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:17.440
Your card relies on luck!  My perfect 
recipe won't lose against it!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.640
Luck is a result of skill!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:26.010
Everyone, let's check the 
cards inside the pancakes!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:27.490
The first card!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.410
Too bad.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.490
The first card isn't a monster.

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.090
The second card!

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:45.670
It's a Performapal!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:50.240
That card isn't good enough to defeat Michio!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.380
The third card!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:58.470
The fourth card!

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:03.550
It's a Performapal, but 
Friendonkey isn't good enough.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.640
Its Level isn't high enough 
to win.  That's too bad.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.580
Too bad?

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:09.840
No, I mean...

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.580
What will the final card be?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.810
I'm excited to see what he'll get!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:18.350
I don't know much about 
dueling, but this is fun!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.840
What?

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.440
Everyone is really into it!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:27.610
It's time for the final pancake!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:32.120
Will the goddess of victory smile upon me?

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.090
Let's find out!  The fifth card!

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:41.950
I got a high-Level Performapal!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.120
Last doesn't mean least!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:48.870
I Special Summon Level 6 
Performapal Elephammer!

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:54.580
The Performapal leader shakes 
the earth as it arrives!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.950
2600 attack points!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:11.190
Me and my perfect recipe are going to lose?

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:13.530
There's no such thing as a perfect recipe!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.670
There's no such thing as 
perfection in cooking.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.510
But if there is such a thing,

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:27.270
it's to think about your customers 
and keep creating new ideas.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.810
Keep creating new ideas...

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.410
Let's battle!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:36.180
Performapal Elephammer attacks you directly!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:39.210
Elephammer, it's feeding time!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.990
I lose.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.920
He did it!

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.580
He got his first victory!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.920
I'm getting shivers!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.040
Thank you for the meal.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.580
He made me shiver...

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:01.890
Michio!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.550
This is a joke, right?

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:06.750
There's no way your perfect recipe can lose!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:09.890
Mama, I lost this time.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.670
Michio?

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.290
Yuya!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.640
I got shivers!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:17.670
Yuya!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.040
You win today.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:26.800
But I will use this defeat as an ingredient 
to create new recipes and improve.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:31.270
Then I'll make sure I improve more than you.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:35.340
I'm looking forward to meeting you 
in the Junior Youth Championship.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:37.890
Yeah!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:45.210
The pancake sandwich wasn't 
enough to satisfy your appetite.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:47.360
I'll cook you something.

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:50.560
Will you accept my hospitality?

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:53.440
Of course.

00:21:54.490 --> 00:22:00.370
I get to taste Michy's home cooking?  Hooray!

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.670
Hooray!  I'm super happy!

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:06.010
Mom...

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:18.610
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:28.090
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:40.100
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:45.340
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:50.780
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:56.010
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.640
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:06.060
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:12.030
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:17.440
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:22.740
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:32.080
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:40.330
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:48.640
Yuzu, are you thinking about him again?

00:23:48.640 --> 00:23:51.410
N-No, I wasn't...

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:57.180
Really?  Well, I was excited that 
I might get a chance to duel him.

00:23:57.180 --> 00:24:01.420
He's dangerous.  His dueling 
creates real explosions.

00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:05.720
Why is LDS chasing me?

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:07.380
You're...

00:24:07.780 --> 00:24:11.890
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Two Shadows of Rebellion

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:14.180
The fun is only getting started!
